c) Convey individual copies of the object code with a copy of the
written offer to provide the Corresponding Source; this alternative is
allowed only occasionally and noncommercially, and only if the
recipient receives the written offer from you.

d) Convey the object code by offering access from a designated place
(gratis or for a charge), and offer equivalent access to the
Corresponding Source in the same way through the same place at no
further charge.  You need not require recipients to copy the
Corresponding Source along with the object code.

e) Convey the object code using a peer-to-peer transmission, provided
you inform other peers where the object code and Corresponding Source
